@startuml 一事件多消费者

' 一个事件多个消费者：每个消费者各自更新各自的领域状态，
' 各归各的查询接口——「多消费者」不是抢一个 HTTP 响应，
' 而是「多领域副作用分散写各自状态」。

control "Event Bus" as Bus
participant "殖民消费者" as C1
participant "停泊消费者" as C2
participant "战斗消费者" as C3
participant "邮件消费者" as C4
database "Planet 状态" as S1
database "Fleet 状态" as S2
database "结果事件(taskId)" as S3
database "Mail 状态" as S4

Bus -> C1: TASKFORCE_ARRIVE(taskId)
Bus -> C2: TASKFORCE_ARRIVE(taskId)
Bus -> C3: TASKFORCE_ARRIVE(taskId)
Bus -> C4: TASKFORCE_ARRIVE(taskId)

C1 -> S1: planet.colonize() 归属变更
C2 -> S2: fleet.arrive() 停泊状态
C3 -> S3: 发 COMBAT_RESULT(taskId)
C4 -> S4: 写战报邮件

note right of S4
    各副作用分散在各资源域，各归各的查询接口：
    GET /planet/:id
    GET /fleet/:id
    GET /combat/report/{taskId}
    GET /mail/unread
end note
@enduml
